        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
          {t('Sustainable choice')}
        </h2>
          <p class="text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('Koha is a mature library system that has been in active development since 1999. Backed by thousands of libraries around the world, its large community ensures Koha keeps up with modern standards and technologies. Koha comes with a responsive design suitable for any desktop or mobile device, and it can be connected to other systems using a number of APIs.')}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-10 text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('One of the main benefits of Koha is the fact that nobody "owns" its source code. GPLv3 license grants anyone the right to copy and modify the software. Unlike proprietary systems, nobody can decide that the development of Koha is over and indirectly force a library to acquire a new system. Anyone at any time can take another copy of Koha and continue its development. Koha will live on for as long as it has an active community providing resources for its maintenance. And there is no sign of slowing down. For this reason we often say that Koha will likely be the last library system your library will ever need.')}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cloud-hosting-service" class="py-32 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-[#0c0c0f] border-y dark:border-zinc-800">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        Koha <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">{t('Cloud Hosting')}</span> {t('Service')}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
        {t('A cost-effective path to migrating your library to Koha. Our small but flexible and experienced team ensures we focus on what really matters - providing you a reliable experience of the best library system in the world.')}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center max-w-8xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal-on-scroll">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-rows-1 gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col hover-glow reveal-on-scroll min-h-[320px] lg:min-h-0" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-accent-600 dark:text-zinc-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6" set:html={`        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 512.001 512.001" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><g><path d="M344.381,143.771C254.765,56.017,102.37,103.776,79.825,227.7c-31.849,4.598-59.138,25.445-72.018,55.076
